      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<h2>Task description</h2>\n\n<br>In this task, you will be shown a label from the EDOS taxonomy and a short paragraph taken from a report.<br><br>Your task is to assess the&nbsp;<strong>Context Relevance</strong>, i.e., if the paragraph contains information that is needed to answer to the harm defined by the EDOS label.",
